{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"p\">\n  <parallel id=\"p\">\n    <state id=\"only\">\n      <transition event=\"go\" target=\"f\"/>\n    </state>\n  </parallel>\n  <final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml033-single-region-parallel.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml033-single-region-parallel.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":8,"byteOffset":77,"endColumn":12,"endLine":2,"startColumn":4,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":"state"}},{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":8,"byteOffset":175,"endColumn":13,"endLine":6,"startColumn":5,"startLine":6},"insertedContent":{"text":"state"}}]}],"description":{"text":"change `<parallel>` to `<state>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml033-single-region-parallel.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":12,"endLine":2,"startColumn":4,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"<parallel> `p` has only one region\n\n**Note:** as a <state>, the region becomes the default child; completion differs: a <parallel> completes when all regions reach final states, while a <state> completes only when one of its own <final> children is entered\n\n**Help:** use `<state>` instead, or add the missing orthogonal regions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.4 <parallel>","text":"<parallel> `p` has only one region"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":85,"start":77},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the only region"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml033-single-region-parallel.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":20,"endLine":3,"startColumn":16,"startLine":3}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML033"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"a parallel state with one child runs nothing in parallel; it is usually a `<state>` written as `<parallel>` or a parallel state missing its other regions (completion semantics differ between the two)"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: use `<state>`, or add the missing orthogonal regions.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.4 <parallel>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML033` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#parallel","id":"SCXML033","name":"SCXML033","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<parallel>` has a single region"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}